			"notes": "Added some core features!\n\n## Features\n-  Finally added functionality to the fletching table!\n    -  Most arrows are now craftable!\n    - The UI is still missing some functionality—namely the Tipping system and shift-clicking (Coming soon). \n- Changes to the Amethyst Arrow.\n    - Gave the shards more Y velocity when shot into the ground.\n    - Made the shards shoot out in the direction opposite from the block hit. This makes it so that they don't just shatter after spawning.\n- Removed the Quartz Arrow :(\n    - Replaced its functionality with the Prismarine Arrow.\n\n###### I'm probably missing something"
