			"notes": "Back at it after a good break!\n\n## Features\n- **Added Functionality to the Amethyst Arrow** \n    - When the arrow hits a target the tip will break off into 3-7 amethyst shards that will go in random directions and deal damage on contact. \n- **Added Functionality to the Gold and Iron Arrow**\n   -  The gold arrow flies farther but deals less damage. Vice versa for the Iron Arrow.\n- **Bug Fixs**\n    - Fixed arrows not being fired by dispensers.\n\n###### Maybe some others I'm missing idk."
